<title>ITALY: Ruggero Mastroianni, film editor, dies - agency.</title>
<headline>Ruggero Mastroianni, film editor, dies - agency.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ruggero Mastroianni, one of Italy's best known film editors and younger brother of actor Marcello Mastroianni, died on Monday aged 66, the Italian news agency ANSA said.</p>
<p>The agency said Mastroianni died of a heart attack at his home in Tor Vaianica, south of Rome.</p>
<p>Mastroianni worked with almost all of Italy's great film directors including the late Federico Fellini.</p>
